# What `tauri dev`'s file watcher skips. It reads ignore files from src-tauri/,
# not the repository's root .gitignore, so the runtimes ignored there are
# listed again here.
#
# The Synara and presentation runtimes are bundled resources that
# `pnpm prepare:runtime:dev` writes as tauri dev's beforeDevCommand, while
# the watcher is already running. Each file it wrote restarted
# `cargo run` (27 times on one cold Windows run, from
# presentation-runtime/node_modules alone). The app reads them at
# launch, so a restart mid-write gains nothing.
/synara-runtime/
/presentation-runtime/
